\":null,\"snoozed_until_at\":null,\"source_comment_id\":null,\"started_at\":null,\"started_triage_at\":null,\"state_id\":{\"id\":\"33849245-b58b-4c69-a1cc-47fb93d35d91\"},\"team_id\":{\"id\":\"0a24709a-8c2e-4bb4-9a60-65c55636927c\"},\"title\":\"Delete test A\",\"trashed\":null,\"triaged_at\":null,\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:57:45.198Z\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/john-doe-demo/issue/JOH-6/delete-test-a\"},{\"added_to_cycle_at\":null,\"added_to_project_at\":null,\"added_to_team_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:32:02.123Z\",\"archived_at\":null,\"assignee_id\":null,\"auto_archived_at\":null,\"auto_closed_at\":null,\"branch_name\":\"acetone-beaches7s/joh-2-connect-your-tools\",\"canceled_at\":null,\"completed_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:32:01.690Z\",\"creator_id\":null,\"customer_ticket_count\":0,\"cycle_id\":null,\"delegate_id\":null,\"description\":\"Integrations turn Linear into your source of truth around product development. Keep data in sync, and eliminate manual updates between tools.\\n\\n![connect-your-tools.png](https://uploads.linear.app/fe63b3e2-bf87-46c0-8784-cd7d639287c8/c2eae035-37e2-4754-adcb-b8305431aa1f/c92d70c7-e6d0-4fa2-a0fd-78f6e780993a)\\n\\n### **Key integrations**\\n\\n* [**Slack**](<https://linear.app/settings/integrations/slack>)\\n  Create issues from Slack messages and sync threads\\n* **[GitHub](<https://linear.app/settings/integrations/github>) / [GitLab](<https://linear.app/settings/integrations/gitlab>)**\\n  Automate your pull request, commit workflows, and keep issues synced both ways\\n* [**Agents**](<https://linear.app/integrations/agents>)\\n  Deploy AI agents that work alongside you as teammates\\n\\n### **Browse all integrations**\\n\\nDiscover 150+ available connections in our [integration directory](<https://linear.app/integrations>) – from bug creation via support tools (Intercom, Zendesk), to issues created from design explorations (Figma).\\n\\n### **Linear API**\\n\\nIf you need something more custom, you can build directly on the Linear API (built on GraphQL). [See our Dev Docs to learn more](<https://linear.app/developers>).\",\"due_date\":null,\"estimate\":null,\"external_user_creator_id\":null,\"id\":\"fa4ec16a-f34b-4caf-ac87-91287926d1bf\",\"identifier\":\"JOH-2\",\"integration_source_type\":null,\"label_ids\":[],\"number\":2,\"parent_id\":null,\"previous_identifiers\":[],\"priority\":0,\"priority_label\":\"No priority\",\"project_id\":null,\"project_milestone_id\":null,\"sla_breaches_at\":null,\"sla_started_at\":null,\"sla_type\":\"all\",\"snoozed_by_id\":null,\"snoozed_until_at\":null,\"source_comment_id\":null,\"started_at\":null,\"started_triage_at\":null,\"state_id\":{\"id\":\"d63ee4ab-def3-4c92-84cd-74154690a031\"},\"team_id\":{\"id\":\"0a24709a-8c2e-4bb4-9a60-65c55636927c\"},\"title\":\"Connect your tools\",\"trashed\":null,\"triaged_at\":null,\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:32:01.690Z\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/john-doe-demo/issue/JOH-2/connect-your-tools\"},{\"added_to_cycle_at\":null,\"added_to_project_at\":null,\"added_to_team_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:32:02.165Z\",\"archived_at\":null,\"assignee_id\":null,\"auto_archived_at\":null,\"auto_closed_at\":null,\"branch_name\":\"acetone-beaches7s/joh-3-import-your-data\",\"canceled_at\":null,\"completed_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:32:01.690Z\",\"creator_id\":null,\"customer_ticket_count\":0,\"cycle_id\":null,\"delegate_id\":null,\"description\":\"Sync data between Linear and your other tools.\\n\\n![import-your-data.png](https://uploads.linear.app/fe63b3e2-bf87-46c0-8784-cd7d639287c8/80d7e050-dd1f-4d4f-8257-b29c16087017/65c16454-30f3-4f4a-8f25-c2428d64ff57)\\n\\nWhether you're exploring Linear, running a pilot, or ready for full migration, we’ve got you covered. \\n\\n### **Exploring Linear:**\\n\\n* [**Pitch Linear**](<https://linear.app/switch/pitch-guide>)\\n  Build your business case and get organizational buy-in\\n* [**Run a pilot**](<https://linear.app/switch/pilot-guide>)\\n  Test Linear with a small team before rolling out company-wide\\n\\n### **Ready to migrate:**\\n\\n* [**Migration guide**](<https://linear.app/switch/migration-guide>) \\n  Step-by-step process for importing data and rolling out Linear\\n\\n---\\n\\nIf you have any questions hit `?` in the bottom left > Contact us.\\n\\n![contactlinear (1).gif](https://uploads.linear.app/fe63b3e2-bf87-46c0-8784-cd7d639287c8/191f6985-8562-4f62-9482-a094b69c4756/0e4ff63b-3da2-4699-912b-04afb68511e8)\",\"due_date\":null,\"estimate\":null,\"external_user_creator_id\":null,\"id\":\"8d3caca7-518e-41fd-9703-25b6c717f260\",\"identifier\":\"JOH-3\",\"integration_source_type\":null,\"label_ids\":[],\"number\":3,\"parent_id\":null,\"previous_identifiers\":[],\"priority\":0,\"priority_label\":\"No priority\",\"project_id\":null,\"project_milestone_id\":null,\"sla_breaches_at\":null,\"sla_started_at\":null,\"sla_type\":\"all\",\"snoozed_by_id\":null,\"snoozed_until_at\":null,\"source_comment_id\":null,\"started_at\":null,\"started_triage_at\":null,\"state_id\":{\"id\":\"d63ee4ab-def3-4c92-84cd-74154690a031\"},\"team_id\":{\"id\":\"0a24709a-8c2e-4bb4-9a60-65c55636927c\"},\"title\":\"Import your data\",\"trashed\":null,\"triaged_at\":null,\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:32:01.690Z\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/john-doe-demo/issue/JOH-3/import-your-data\"},{\"added_to_cycle_at\":null,\"added_to_project_at\":null,\"added_to_team_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:32:02.079Z\",\"archived_at\":null,\"assignee_id\":null,\"auto_archived_at\":null,\"auto_closed_at\":null,\"branch_name\":\"acetone-beaches7s/joh-1-get-familiar-with-linear\",\"canceled_at\":null,\"completed_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:32:01.690Z\",\"creator_id\":null,\"customer_ticket_count\":0,\"cycle_id\":null,\"delegate_id\":null,\"description\":\"Welcome to Linear! \\n\\nWatch an introductory video and access a list of resources below.\\n\\n[LinearH264Version_1.mp4](https://uploads.linear.app/fe63b3e2-bf87-46c0-8784-cd7d639287c8/a044fb03-9b84-470c-ab6f-8eae613e2529/98d7274d-de7f-4910-b3f3-f72e8e286a98)\\n\\n### **Choose your setup guide** based on your company stage:\\n\\n* [Small teams](<https://linear.app/docs/how-to-use-linear-small-teams>)\\n  For early-stage startups and projects\\n* [Startups & mid-size companies](<https://linear.app/docs/how-to-use-linear-startups-mid-size-companies>)\\n  For growing teams with cross-functional needs\\n* [Large & scaling companies](<https://linear.app/docs/how-to-use-linear-large-scaling-companies>)\\n  For enterprise and high-growth teams with complex workflows\\n\\n### **Need help getting started?**\\n\\n* [Join our Slack community](<https://linear.app/join-slack>)\\n  Connect with other Linear users and get tips\\n* [Join a live ](<https://lu.ma/welcome-to-linear?utm_source=docs>)[onboarding](<https://lu.ma/welcome-to-linear?utm_source=onboarding>)[ ](<https://lu.ma/welcome-to-linear?utm_source=docs>)[session](<https://lu.ma/welcome-to-linear?utm_source=onboarding>)\\n  Learn the essentials and see demos of core workflows\\n\\n---\\n\\nIf you have any questions hit `?` in the bottom left > Contact us.\\n\\n![contactlinear (1).gif](https://uploads.linear.app/fe63b3e2-bf87-46c0-8784-cd7d639287c8/bc9bbf62-4192-411f-88f6-c89c9150503e/4df0346e-803b-4f58-8527-4aeb30d88411)\",\"due_date\":null,\"estimate\":null,\"external_user_creator_id\":null,\"id\":\"8c75af1c-6960-45e0-a949-500baa23a8b7\",\"identifier\":\"JOH-1\",\"integration_source_type\":null,\"label_ids\":[],\"number\":1,\"parent_id\":null,\"previous_identifiers\":[],\"priority\":0,\"priority_label\":\"No priority\",\"project_id\":null,\"project_milestone_id\":null,\"sla_breaches_at\":null,\"sla_started_at\":null,\"sla_type\":\"all\",\"snoozed_by_id\":null,\"snoozed_until_at\":null,\"source_comment_id\":null,\"started_at\":null,\"started_triage_at\":null,\"state_id\":{\"id\":\"d63ee4ab-def3-4c92-84cd-74154690a031\"},\"team_id\":{\"id\":\"0a24709a-8c2e-4bb4-9a60-65c55636927c\"},\"title\":\"Get familiar with Linear\",\"trashed\":null,\"triaged_at\":null,\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:32:01.690Z\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/john-doe-demo/issue/JOH-1/get-familiar-with-linear\"},{\"added_to_cycle_at\":null,\"added_to_project_at\":null,\"added_to_team_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:32:02.208Z\",\"archived_at\":null,\"assignee_id\":null,\"auto_archived_at\":null,\"auto_closed_at\":null,\"branch_name\":\"acetone-beaches7s/joh-4-set-up-your-teams\",\"canceled_at\":null,\"completed_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:32:01.690Z\",\"creator_id\":null,\"customer_ticket_count\":0,\"cycle_id\":null,\"delegate_id\":null,\"description\":\"This workspace is a container for your organization’s work. \\n\\n* [Learn more about Workspaces](<https://linear.app/docs/workspaces>)\\n  How to configure settings and workflows \\n\\nTeams are how you organize people and work in Linear.\\n\\n* [Learn about Teams](<https://linear.app/docs/teams>)\\n  How to structure teams and configure workflows\\n\\nTeams are made of members with defined roles (Admin, Member, Guest).\\n\\n* [Learn more about Members](<https://linear.app/docs/invite-members>)\\n  Add your team and assign roles\\n\\n---\\n\\nReady to add your team? Invite via CSV or a unique link in [settings](<http://linear.app/settings/members>).\",\"due_date\":null,\"estimate\":null,\"external_user_creator_id\":null,\"id\":\"28051b04-c300-401b-bd47-0bae6b5f238d\",\"identifier\":\"JOH-4\",\"integration_source_type\":null,\"label_ids\":[],\"number\":4,\"parent_id\":null,\"previous_identifiers\":[],\"priority\":0,\"priority_label\":\"No priority\",\"project_id\":null,\"project_milestone_id\":null,\"sla_breaches_at\":null,\"sla_started_at\":null,\"sla_type\":\"all\",\"snoozed_by_id\":null,\"snoozed_until_at\":null,\"source_comment_id\":null,\"started_at\":null,\"started_triage_at\":null,\"state_id\":{\"id\":\"d63ee4ab-def3-4c92-84cd-74154690a031\"},\"team_id\":{\"id\":\"0a24709a-8c2e-4bb4-9a60-65c55636927c\"},\"title\":\"Set up your teams\",\"trashed\":null,\"triaged_at\":nul